P_7Ig-caZlPKhTZsFtjWc-3OIJqA&oe=69E0D913"}, {"file_name": "Recording Radial Pulse Simulator_SS_05.png", "id": "837151848339615", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43931336_837151851672948_3791241212278429846_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=89rGiE4zFZYQ7kNvwEiqGxv&_nc_oc=AdrzJ16RxXm2Mx7dkBXuhP9-9rBl_0J6emSDBVm6mQqYfOoCvz0E9pEK4TmWGV8QF8o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1yEM7cFi9Dzh3m1lBrNeDa37xCGGEkeN4-Q5bhD8n92g&oe=69E0CC27"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440.png", "id": "3812821238933502", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982527_3812821242266835_422188521434867194_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oqdGt2Ggih0Q7kNvwG4q4HH&_nc_oc=AdoFuk565zSepRF7nlRf20vfETJfYoo7kO_jKSfAc8fglXdh1Wf4PiS5VxYr7yY8_AA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1mEG-yOnHP_9gPdZnvbpThDffPLooZJlO_cEAus_mT_A&oe=69E0EA4C"}, "display_name": "Recording Radial Pulse Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This tutorial covers the essential steps for measuring and recording a patient's radial pulse. It includes preparation, locating the pulse, measurement, and documentation. By the end of this tutorial, learners will be able to: \n\nRemember the key steps in recording a radial pulse. \n- Understand the significance of pulse measurement in patient assessment. \n- Apply the correct techniques to ensure accurate pulse recording. \n- Analyze pulse data to detect any irregularities. \n- Evaluate their measurement accuracy and identify areas for improvement. \n- Create precise and thorough patient records based on their findings. \n\nThis comprehensive approach ensures CNAs are well-prepared to assist patients with feeding efficiently and compassionately in real-world clinical settings. ", "short_description": "Develop proficiency in accurately recording a patient's radial pulse."}]}, "developer_name": null, 